control: A verdict made under another scanner returns to pending, cleared, with its sender's prior hits counted again
removes: a backfill run returns no verdict to pending before its first pass, so stale verdicts keep releasing bodies
packages: ./backfill
tests: TestAChangeOfScannerMasksAndScansAgain
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

